      "writtenOn": "2026-09-07T09:01:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is implementing https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp/+/refs/tags/v1.6.0/sharpyuv/sharpyuv_gamma.c#107 and FixedPointInterpolation  But tab_value_shift should be 0 so no shift here right ? What about the shift by 7 above ? Where does it come from ? Why is tab_pos_shift_right \u003d\u003d 7 ?",
      "revId": "ade403154fbc49592f608d740495772128ef5ab3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
