      "writtenOn": "2026-09-07T13:18:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "good question: the \u00277\u0027 here is GAMMA_TO_LINEAR_BITS - LINEAR_TO_GAMMA_TAB_BITS, that\u0027s 16 - 9 \u003d 7.\nAnd tab_value_shift is \u0027SHARPYUV_GAMMA_TO_LINEAR_BITS - bit_depth\u0027, in the positive direction. C\u0027s implementation uses `Shift()`, which analyzes the sign.",
      "parentUuid": "68c52b80_5b82cad6",
